{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<div class=\"text_box\">\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港仍然保留端午節傳統，舉行龍舟競渡，龍舟精英各顯身手，欣賞各區盛況。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-19T11:39:25.164024+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":35,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"unknown"}}